  "reason": "Monty rejects generator functions at parse time. The pinned Monty v1.0.0 documentation lists yield/yield from as a statement rejected at parse time with NotImplementedError, since there are no generator functions. Generator expressions parse but currently materialize to a list rather than a lazy iterator. This is a language limitation, not a BrassClaw policy restriction. A Monty component cannot implement a generator function using yield.",
